; Cloudflare DNS import — hyperion-industries.dev
; GitHub Pages + subdomain stubs
; Generated for: CHRON.OS Preview · Hyperion Industries
;
; IMPORT INSTRUCTIONS:
;   Cloudflare → DNS → Records → Import and Export → Select a file → choose this file
;   Leave "Proxy imported DNS records" UNCHECKED (GitHub Pages needs DNS-only for cert check)
;   After GitHub Pages HTTPS is confirmed, you can proxy the A records if desired.

$ORIGIN hyperion-industries.dev.

