@   300  IN  A  185.199.108.153
@   300  IN  A  185.199.109.153
@   300  IN  A  185.199.110.153
@   300  IN  A  185.199.111.153

; ----- www → GitHub Pages -----
www  300  IN  CNAME  code-xer0.github.io.

; ----- Future product subdomains (staged, DNS-only) -----
chronos  300  IN  CNAME  code-xer0.github.io.
mnem     300  IN  CNAME  code-xer0.github.io.
